tion, and Adversarial Training in NLP.\"","â€œBot-Adversarial Dialogue for Safe Conversational Agents.â€","â€œAdversarial training for high-stakes reliability.â€","â€œRed Teaming Language Models to Reduce Harms: Methods, Scaling Behaviors, and Lessons Learned.â€","â€œRed Teaming Language Models with Language Models.â€","â€œRed Teaming Language Models to Reduce Harms: Methods, Scaling Behaviors, and Lessons Learned.â€","â€œFLIRT: Feedback Loop In-context Red Teaming.â€","â€œExplore, Establish, Exploit: Red Teaming Language Models from Scratch.â€","â€œDefending ChatGPT against Jailbreak Attack via Self-Reminder.â€","â€œAutomatically Auditing Large Language Models via Discrete Optimization.â€","â€œCompromising Real-World LLM-Integrated Applications with Indirect Prompt Injection.â€","â€œBaseline Defenses for Adversarial Attacks Against Aligned Language Models.â€","â€œJailbroken: How Does LLM Safety Training Fail?â€","â€œEDA: Easy data augmentation techniques for boosting performance on text classification tasks.â€","www.jailbreakchat.com","â€œYou can use GPT-4 to create prompt injections against GPT-4â€","Nlp","Language-Model","Safety","Adversarial Attacks","Robustness","Redteam"],"emphasized_text_contents":["black box","What","NOUN","â†’Which","NOUN","WP","is â†’","WP","â€™sâ€™","wasâ†’is","GBDA","make adversarial loss optimization differentiable","extreme","â€œa similarity score for evaluating text generation that captures the semantic similarity between pairwise tokens in contextualized embeddings of a transformer model.â€","HotFlip","Universal Adversarial Triggers","UAT","AutoPrompt","UAT-LM","UTSC","unigram","affirmative","greedy coordinate gradient (GCG)","transferability","ARCA","coordinate ascent","should have been mitigated","Competing objective","Mismatched generalization","Display of saliency score of each token","Token substitution and insertion","Zero-shot generation","Stochastic few-shot generation","Supervised learning","Reinforcement lear